From physics and chemistry...

Maxwell's Demon is a fictional being designed to illustrate some
concepts in thermodynamics.  Maxwell proposed that if a little demon
could sit in between two connected containers and open and close the
connection between the containers at will, then he could allow all
the fast hot molecules to enter one container and all the slow molecules
to enter the other (simple by opening and closing the gate at the right
times).  And by doing so, he could produce "free energy" by reducing the
entropy of the system.  This little demon became known as Maxwell's Demon.


